{"id": 132, "name": "Marcel", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/2/27/Hero1321-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20260311075303", "cls": ["Support", ""], "specialty": ["Crowd Control", "Support"], "difficulty": "30", "stats": ["70", "30", "100", "30"], "lanes": ["Roam", ""], "story": "Hailing from House Paxley, he is an elegant, mysterious, and bizarre artist whose split soul has fused with his camera.", "skills": [{"name": "Platinum Snap", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60/100_7548012a0f8fcbf32ac9b635406cc6e4.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 1, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "193,176,64"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Marcel's split soul, <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Clemar</span>, enters the camera to freeze the moment. Marcel's Basic Attacks deal 50<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span><span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+40% Total Magic Defense)</span><span style=\"color:#fba51f\"></span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> (cannot Crit). He cannot benefit from extra Attack Speed. Extra HP is converted into 1.5% Hybrid Defense.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Clemar</span> automatically snaps photos of enemy heroes near Marcel, causing a brief <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Frozen Moment</span> and dealing 20 (+ 5% their Max HP) <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">True Damage</span> (triggers Attack Effects). It also grants a shield of the same value to Marcel and a nearby allied hero. Cooldown: 12s per target (each Basic Attack from Marcel reduces this cooldown by 1s)."}, {"name": "Framed Moment", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60/100_8cc948ee89d2fd1a4c581fb14c5dec23.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 2, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "188,55,55"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12.5   Mana Cost: 40", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Clemar</span> focuses on an area around Marcel, slowing enemy heroes within by 20%. After 2.5s, he completes the shot, dealing 370<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span><span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+100% Total Magic Defense)</span><span style=\"color:#fba51f\"></span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies within and immobilizing them for 1s."}, {"name": "Tracking Shot", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60/100_f5fc45ee46ef9230c3bdf1229076b28f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 11, "tagname": "Speed Up", "tagrgb": "91,208,207"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12.5   Mana Cost: 70", "desc": "Artist inspiration time! Marcel enters the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Tracking Haste</span> state for 3s, gaining 15% Movement Speed (increases to 75% when moving toward enemy heroes).\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Marcel dashes in the target direction, leaving a framing phantom behind. If <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Framed Moment</span> is active, <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Clemar</span> remains at the original location to continue shooting."}, {"name": "Golden Hour", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60/100_21b96ee6970aa33e77fca022e56ad216.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 1, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "193,176,64"}], "cdcost": "CD: 74   Mana Cost: 150", "desc": "Marcel and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Clemar</span> perform a joint shoot. After a short delay, <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Clemar</span> takes a wide-angle shot of the target area for 3s. During this time, Marcel enters the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Tracking Haste</span> state while inside the area. All other units in the area are put into a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Frozen Moment</span> and are immune to all effects except from Marcel. All ranged Basic Attacks and projectiles are also frozen and will continue after a delay.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Golden Hour</span> resets the cooldown of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Platinum Snap</span> for each enemy hero.\nAllied heroes with the <span 